              <li><a href="/blog/troubleshooting-pinterest-downloads" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Fix Download Errors</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/how-to-download-pinterest-board-as-zip" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Download Boards as ZIP</a></li>
              <li><a href="/blog/pin-vs-board-vs-profile-urls-explained" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Pin vs Board vs Profile URLs</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 text-base">Trust & Legal</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold">
              <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">About viralNest</a></li>
              <li><a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a></li>
              <li><a href="/terms-of-service" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Terms of Service</a></li>
              <li><a href="/contact" class="hover:text-[#E60023] transition-colors">Contact Us</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 text-base">About viralNest</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
              viralNest is a free online media extraction engine allowing creators, designers, and users to save Pinterest videos, images, GIFs, and audio files cleanly without watermarks.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-800">viral<span class="text-[#E60023]">Nest</span></span>
            <span>&copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} — Free Online Pinterest Media Downloader</span>
